{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":46.290000915527344,"text":"At the top of the medieval town stands a castle with two round towers at its gate. The knights of St. John built it in the 14th century on top of an older Byzantine fort, and it was the center of their power. It survived sieges. What it did not survive was something far more foolish. In 1856, gunpowder left forgotten in a cellar since the time of the knights exploded, and the palace was a ruin in almost a moment. It stayed that way for 80 years. In the late 1930s, when the Dodecanese were under Italian administration, it was rebuilt from the ground up. To lay the floors, ancient mosaics were shipped in from the island of Kos, so today you walk through a medieval castle across Roman floors from somewhere else.","words":[{"word":"At","start":0,"end":0.41999998688697815},{"word":"the","start":0.41999998688697815,"end":0.5799999833106995},{"word":"top","start":0.5799999833106995,"end":0.8199999928474426},{"word":"of","start":0.8199999928474426,"end":1},{"word":"the","start":1,"end":1.1799999475479126},{"word":"medieval","start":1.1799999475479126,"end":1.5},{"word":"town","start":1.5,"end":1.940000057220459},{"word":"stands","start":1.940000057220459,"end":2.3399999141693115},{"word":"a","start":2.3399999141693115,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"castle","start":2.880000114440918,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"with","start":2.880000114440918,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"two","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.640000104904175},{"word":"round","start":3.640000104904175,"end":3.9200000762939453},{"word":"towers","start":3.9200000762939453,"end":4.21999979019165},{"word":"at","start":4.21999979019165,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"its","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.699999809265137},{"word":"gate","start":4.699999809265137,"end":4.900000095367432},{"word":"The","start":5.519999980926514,"end":5.960000038146973},{"word":"knights","start":5.960000038146973,"end":5.960000038146973},{"